      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Jarryd and his team from Iluminec were fantastic.Jarryd responded promptly to my initial enquiry about installing a solar system. There was no hesitation in him meeting with me in my home to assess and explain what system he would recommend and at what cost. He informed me of the current government rebates available and supplied me with written information as well as talking about it.Jarryd supported me every step along the way towards and following installation. I sometimes feel that as a mature aged person on my own I am an easy target to take advantage of but I never felt that with Ilumenec. Jarryd checked in with me assuring my understanding  and was very generous with his time.I always felt respected and safe with the team.The team were punctual and polite with me and cleaned up after themselves!! not always the case with tradespeople.Jarryd followed up with connection to the grid doing what he could to alleviate any challenges with service providers.I have no hesitation in recommending Ilumenec to anyone. I was very happy and felt that they were very professional. Service as it used to be!!",
